avatars/ona.glb
  Created with Blender and the MPFB extension from MakeHuman system assets.
  License: CC0 1.0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).

avatars/saule.glb
  Adapted from "brunette.glb" in TalkingHead by met4citizen
  (https://github.com/met4citizen/TalkingHead), created at Ready Player Me
  (https://readyplayer.me/).
  Changes: hair recoloured to blonde, glasses removed, clothing recoloured
  (tools/make_rpm_variant.py).
  License: CC BY-NC 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/).
  Non-commercial use only. Keep this attribution when you share it.

avatars/brunette.glb
  From TalkingHead by met4citizen (https://github.com/met4citizen/TalkingHead),
  created at Ready Player Me (https://readyplayer.me/).
  License: CC BY-NC 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/).

avatars/avaturn.glb
  From TalkingHead by met4citizen (https://github.com/met4citizen/TalkingHead),
  created with Avaturn (https://avaturn.me/).
  License: CC BY-NC 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/).

avatars/avatarsdk.glb
  From TalkingHead by met4citizen (https://github.com/met4citizen/TalkingHead),
  created with AvatarSDK by itseez3D (https://avatarsdk.com/).
  License: CC BY-NC 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/).

Avatars loaded at runtime from the TalkingHead repository are not part of this
repository and keep their own licenses (mostly CC BY-NC 4.0).

